    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101167" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνωμ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦμος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>space between the shoulder-blades, withers</i>, in the
